  "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat(ui): host-provided workflow validation via spi.validate by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/43\n* feat(ui): corner validation badge + per-node problem surfacing by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/44\n* feat(ui): auto-layout for workflows (dagre) by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/45\n* docs: document post-1.0 features and correct stale references by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/56\n* chore(deps): update dependency typescript-eslint to v8.69.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/46\n* feat: optional rich output-field metadata for human-task nodes by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/57\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/compare/v1.0.2...v1.0.3",
